notes.content:
Hello Lost In Failures players! From the date of publication of this announcement, a new version of the product will be available. The update fixes some issues and inconsistencies that were present in the release version. Check out the improvements and fixes made below.


 Issues related to the crafting of items and structures have been resolved;
 The speed at which the player moves while swimming has been increased by 125%;
 The volume of pre-rendered cutscenes has been adjusted;
 Fixed issues preventing the achievement "Kyros' last breath", "The End of Argos", "The last tears of Amphitrite" and "The last flame of Perseus" from being obtained;
 The inconsistencies generated in the interface after getting a document inside a fort have been fixed; 
 Issues related to the languages present in the game have been resolved.
